etting started and as  predicted we learned a lot more  information about the Warhammer Titan  and it's truly impressive powers in  Chapter 102 of the manga and I can't  wait to talk about it all right here in  this video if you enjoyed the attack on  titan content on this channel and you  want to see more be sure to leave a like  to let me know if you're new don't  forget to subscribe and hit that  notification bell and we are now posting  daily anime content on twitter and  instagram so feel free to follow us  at Anime uproar the Warhammer Titan has  been in the possession of a noble LD and  family known as the timers for many  generations and the Tiber family is  unique because despite being LD ins they  are treated with respect and allowed to  live freely in Marlay on top of that we  later learn from Willie Tiber that the  Tiber family are actually the secret  rulers of Marlay and I am sure that the  Warhammer tightened with its incredible  abilities constitutes a major factor in  how the timers were able to attain this  position when we first see the Warhammer  Titan appear after Aaron's attack on  Willie  Aaron's attacked Titan pounces right  away so we don't even get to see the  Warhammer Titans full transformation  until it uses its unique ability to  impale Aaron on a giant spike that seems  to shoot up from the ground when we  finally do see the Warhammer Titan it is  definitely an absolutely unique form  with a helmet like cover on its head  that includes straps across the eyes and  mouth the appearance of the Warhammer  Titan has been compared to the armor of  a medieval knight to an executioner and  even to the Grim Reaper the incredible  power of the Warhammer Titan has also  been compared to alchemy think of Edward  Elric from Full Metal Alchemist and this  is because the Warhammer Titan can  literally create weapons from its body  many Titan shifters have the ability to  harden their body or parts of their body  but the Warhammer Titan can use this  