s body collapse however Willy Tiber  sister is not frozen inside the crystal  on the contrary she remains conscious  inside the crystal and she is aware of  what's going on we see her open her eyes  inside the crystal and when she sees the  right opportunity she is able to  transform again and create a new Titan  body from inside the crystal this was a  huge reveal for me personally because  this means that Annie is most likely  still conscious and aware of what is  going on inside her crystal as well  annie is unable to transform at this  time because her crystal is being kept  underground but knowing what we know now  regarding Willie's sister it is safe to  assume that if Annie's crystal is moved  at some point and she sees the right  opportunity she could choose to trigger  another Titan transformation and use it  to escape from the survey Corps maybe  Annie has already made a move at some  point during the time skip and we just  don't know it yet I am certain that the  unique powers of the Warhammer Titan  have some sort of significance for any  situation and I can't wait to see where  the Annie story line goes from  here aside from the Warhammer Titans  incredible powers including generating  epic weapons of various shapes and sizes  being able to take damage to the nape  without being heard due to the fact that  the shifter is outside of the body and  having excellent stamina that allows the  shifter to create a new Titan as soon as  the core to the old one is severed the  Warhammer Titan likely has additional  advantages if the story that we've been  told so far is true and we cannot know  for sure because it is clear that Willie  has been lying about certain things but  if the Warhammer tyne really has been  within the same family for generations  then this would mean that the current  shifter Willie Tiber sister is able to  access the memories of the previous  shifters without problem when a Titan  shifter power is held within the same  family such as the 