d that noble family so  I can definitely see that in cases where  the King had multiple children some of  the children could have married into the  Tiber family and this would mean that at  the current point in history the tie  burrs also have royal blood one hint  that could point to this is the fact  that the Warhammer Titan is able to  speak in complete sentences while in its  Titan form whereas most Titans seem to  have trouble speaking just think of Amir  when she was in her jaw tighten form and  how her words came out when she spoke as  a Titan on the other hand the Titan that  speaks the most clearly and in the most  complete sentences is zeke Yeager's  beast Titan and of course we know that  Zeke has royal blood so this could be a  clue however we don't have enough  evidence to say for sure at this point  so at this time the idea that the Tiber  Sirois alot is just my theory personally  I can't wait to see what else the  Warhammer Titan has in store and I'm  looking forward to finding out more  about the Tiber family and their history  let me know what you guys think  do you like the Warhammer Titans power  and where do you think that the  Warhammer Titan ranks on the list of the  most powerful Titan shifters also let me  know whether you think that the Tiber  family has royal blood if you enjoy the  attack on titan videos on this channel  and you'd like to see more be sure to  leave a like to let me know if you are  new to the channel don't forget to  subscribe and hit that notification bell  be sure to join us on discord and twitch  where we're gonna be having parties to  celebrate the fact that we hit over  100,000 subscribers  it's crazy thank you all again and we  are also posting daily anime content on  Twitter and Instagram so feel free to  follow us there at anime uproar as  always thank you all so much for  watching thank you again for the  unbelievable support and until next time  see us space cowboys  [Music]  you  [Music]

